Parts of this package are ported from Sandcastle by Matt Pocock
(https://github.com/mattpocock/sandcastle, npm `@ai-hero/sandcastle`), released
under the MIT License. Specifically, the shape of the streaming `exec(cmd,
{ onLine, stdin })` contract, the per-agent CLI command builders
(`src/adapters/claudeCode.ts`, `codex.ts`, `cursor.ts`, `opencode.ts`) and the
NDJSON line parsers follow Sandcastle's `src/AgentProvider.ts`; the agent image
(`docker/agent.Dockerfile`) follows the lineage of Sandcastle's scaffolded
`node:22-bookworm` + non-root `agent` (uid 1000) image. Sandcastle itself is not
a dependency (docs/research/agent-sandboxes.md §2).

